{"seq":1,"slug":"zk-to-kraft-migration-rollout","title":"ZooKeeper 到 KRaft 迁移与滚动切换（双写过渡、controller 引导、broker/controller 迁移顺序）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kafka-kraft-raft-storage-internals-broker/operations-migration-upgrade/zk-to-kraft-migration-rollout","wordCount":2342,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"zookeeper-到-kraft-迁移与滚动切换-双写过渡-controller-引导-broker-controller-迁移顺序\">ZooKeeper 到 KRaft 迁移与滚动切换（双写过渡、controller 引导、broker/controller 迁移顺序）</h1><p>一个跑了六年的 ZooKeeper 模式集群要搬到 KRaft，最危险的不是&quot;怎么迁&quot;，而是&quot;迁到一半的时候谁在读元数据&quot;。KIP-866 没有把迁移设计成一次性切换，而是设计成一台有明确状态的机器：controller 先接管、再把每次元数据变更<strong>同时</strong>写进 ZooKeeper 和 <code>__cluster_metadata</code> 日志（双写），broker 一台一台地滚进 KRaft 模式；直到最后一台 broker 迁完，双写才停止。整个过程中，集群里始终同时存在&quot;读 ZK 的 broker&quot;和&quot;读 metadata log 的 broker&quot;两类消费者——理解这一点，后面所有顺序约束和回滚边界都只是它的推论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-zkmigrationstate-迁移状态机\">核心概念：ZkMigrationState 迁移状态机</h2><p>controller 的元数据 quorum 里记录着一个显式的迁移状态，用 <code>kafka-metadata-quorum.sh --bootstrap-controller &lt;host:9093&gt; describe --status</code> 可以看到输出中的 <code>ZkMigrationState</code> 字段（<a href=\"https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-866+ZooKeeper+to+KRaft+Migration\">KIP-866</a>）。它不是日志里的一个普通 record，而是 controller 内存状态机驱动行为开关的输入：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><code>ZkMigrationState</code></th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>谁还在读 ZK</th>\n<th>谁在写 ZK</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>NONE</code></td>\n<td>从未迁移过，或已是纯 KRaft</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PRE_MIGRATION</code></td>\n<td>controller quorum 已格式化启动，但尚未接管</td>\n<td>全部 broker</td>\n<td>旧的 ZK controller</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>MIGRATION</code></td>\n<td>controller 已接管，正在双写</td>\n<td>尚未迁移的 broker</td>\n<td>KRaft active controller（双写两条路径）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POST_MIGRATION</code></td>\n<td>全部 broker 已迁移，controller 停止写 ZK</td>\n<td>仅 controller 做收尾读取</td>\n<td>KRaft active controller（只写 metadata log）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>状态从 <code>PRE_MIGRATION</code> 跳到 <code>MIGRATION</code> 的瞬间，就是 KRaft controller 抢占 ZooKeeper 里 <code>/controller</code> 那个临时 znode 的时刻——从那一刻起，ZK 模式 broker 以为自己在跟老 controller 说话，实际上控制平面已经换人了。这是整个迁移里唯一一次&quot;控制面切换&quot;，此后的一切都属于数据面追赶。</p>\n<p>双写为什么必须存在，用一张读路径图就能说清：迁移期的元数据有两条独立的物化路径，任何一次 topic 创建、分区扩容、leader 变更都必须落到两条路径上，否则还没迁移的 broker 会读到陈旧状态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    AC[Active KRaft Controller] --&gt;|1 写 metadata log| ML[(__cluster_metadata)]&#10;    AC --&gt;|2 双写 legacy znode| ZK[(ZooKeeper ensemble)]&#10;    ML --&gt;|observer fetch| MB[已迁移 broker&lt;br/&gt;process.roles=broker]&#10;    ML --&gt;|observer fetch| SB[controller standby]&#10;    ZK --&gt;|read 元数据| OB[未迁移 broker&lt;br/&gt;ZK 模式]&#10;    OB -.-&gt;|注册/心跳| ZK\">graph TD\n    AC[Active KRaft Controller] --&gt;|1 写 metadata log| ML[(__cluster_metadata)]\n    AC --&gt;|2 双写 legacy znode| ZK[(ZooKeeper ensemble)]\n    ML --&gt;|observer fetch| MB[已迁移 broker&lt;br/&gt;process.roles=broker]\n    ML --&gt;|observer fetch| SB[controller standby]\n    ZK --&gt;|read 元数据| OB[未迁移 broker&lt;br/&gt;ZK 模式]\n    OB -.-&gt;|注册/心跳| ZK</pre><p>设迁移期间元数据变更速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>meta</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{meta}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">meta</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（次/秒），双写窗口时长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>dual</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{dual}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 controller 在窗口内额外承担的总持久化写次数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>extra</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>meta</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>dual</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{extra}} = \\lambda_{\\text{meta}} \\times T_{\\text{dual}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">extra</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">meta</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个量级决定迁移该不该在大促前做。跨境电商集群在活动期会集中创建营销 topic、扩容分区，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>meta</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{meta}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">meta</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可能十倍于平时；把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>dual</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{dual}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压在活动窗口之外，比事后优化 controller 磁盘更有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阶段一-先引导-controller-quorum-不动任何-broker\">阶段一：先引导 controller quorum，不动任何 broker</h2><p>迁移顺序的第一条硬约束：<strong>controller 全部就位并被识别为 <code>MIGRATION</code> 之后，才允许动第一台 broker</strong>。反过来做没有意义——broker 一旦以迁移模式启动，就会去 <code>controller.quorum.voters</code> 里找 quorum，找不到就起不来。</p>\n<p>controller 节点的关键配置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>迁移期取值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>process.roles</code></td>\n<td><code>controller</code></td>\n<td>迁移期不要用 combined 模式；combined 无法独立滚动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>node.id</code></td>\n<td>如 <code>3000</code>/<code>3001</code>/<code>3002</code></td>\n<td>必须与所有既有 <code>broker.id</code> 不冲突，KRaft 共用同一 ID 命名空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>controller.quorum.voters</code></td>\n<td><code>3000@c1:9093,3001@c2:9093,3002@c3:9093</code></td>\n<td>全量列出，不能用 hostname 解析歧义的形式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>controller.listener.names</code></td>\n<td><code>CONTROLLER</code></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>listeners</code></td>\n<td><code>CONTROLLER://:9093</code></td>\n<td>独立于 <code>PLAINTEXT</code>/<code>SSL</code> 数据面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>zookeeper.connect</code></td>\n<td>原 ZK 连接串</td>\n<td>迁移期必填</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>zookeeper.metadata.migration.enable</code></td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n<td>打开迁移模式的开关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>格式化时最容易出错的一步是 <code>--cluster-id</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# cluster id 必须取自 ZooKeeper 的 /cluster/id znode，不是 kafka-storage.sh random-uuid&#10;bin/kafka-storage.sh format \\&#10;  --cluster-id &quot;$(bin/zookeeper-shell.sh zk1:2181 get /cluster/id | tail -1 | jq -r .id)&quot; \\&#10;  --config controller.properties\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># cluster id 必须取自 ZooKeeper 的 /cluster/id znode，不是 kafka-storage.sh random-uuid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bin/kafka-storage.sh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> format</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --cluster-id</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bin/zookeeper-shell.sh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zk1:2181 get /cluster/id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tail</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .id)\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> controller.properties</span></span></code></pre></div><p>重新生成一个 cluster id 会让所有 broker 拒绝加入 quorum，而报错只提示 cluster id 不匹配。格式化完成后依次启动三个 controller，第一个拿到多数派的成为 active，立即做两件事：把 ZK 中已有的 znode 状态（<code>/brokers</code>、<code>/config</code>、<code>/admin</code>、ACL 与 SCRAM 凭证）读成一批 <code>MetadataRecord</code> 追加进元数据日志；然后抢占 <code>/controller</code>。这一步的产物体量和集群规模成正比，十万级分区的集群会在 metadata log 里一次性写入数十万条记录——这正是<a href=\"../metadata-log-record-storage/metadata-snapshot-generation-load\">元数据快照的生成与加载</a>要做重活的时刻，也是 3.6/3.7 几个版本集中优化的痛点。</p>\n<p>用 <code>kafka-metadata-quorum.sh --bootstrap-controller c1:9093 describe --status</code> 确认 <code>ZkMigrationState</code> 已进入 <code>MIGRATION</code>、<code>LeaderId</code> 稳定、<code>CurrentVoters</code> 与预期一致，再进入下一阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阶段二-broker-逐台滚动迁移\">阶段二：broker 逐台滚动迁移</h2><p>broker 侧配置在 ZK 模式基础上加三样东西，并把角色从&quot;由 ZK 分配&quot;改成显式声明：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"properties\" data-code=\"process.roles=broker&#10;node.id=1                                  # 必须等于原来的 broker.id&#10;controller.quorum.voters=3000@c1:9093,3001@c2:9093,3002@c3:9093&#10;zookeeper.connect=zk1:2181,zk2:2181,zk3:2181&#10;zookeeper.metadata.migration.enable=true   # 迁移模式\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>process.roles=broker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>node.id=1                                  # 必须等于原来的 broker.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>controller.quorum.voters=3000@c1:9093,3001@c2:9093,3002@c3:9093</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>zookeeper.connect=zk1:2181,zk2:2181,zk3:2181</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>zookeeper.metadata.migration.enable=true   # 迁移模式</span></span></code></pre></div><p>单台 broker 的迁移动作只有三步：停进程 → <code>kafka-storage.sh format --cluster-id &lt;同一个 id&gt; --config broker.properties</code> → 启动。注意 <code>node.id</code> 与原 <code>broker.id</code> 必须一致，否则这台 broker 在元数据里会被当成一个全新节点，既有副本会被判为离线并触发大规模 leader 选举。</p>\n<p>迁移模式下的 broker 有一个特殊身份：它<strong>同时</strong>注册到 ZK 和 KRaft quorum，在 metadata quorum 里表现为一个 observer（<code>describe --status</code> 的 <code>CurrentObservers</code> 列表会变长），元数据缓存改由 metadata log 提供，不再依赖 ZK 通知。每迁一台 broker，controller 的 observer 复制流就多一条——controller 的出口带宽与 follower 追赶能力成为滚动速度的实际瓶颈。</p>\n<p><strong>必须一台一台来。</strong> 每台重启后，用 <code>kafka-metadata-quorum.sh --bootstrap-controller c1:9093 describe --replication</code> 找到该 broker 对应的 observer 行，确认它的 <code>LogEndOffset</code> 与 active controller 的 <code>HighWatermark</code> 差值收敛到接近 0，再动下一台。同时用 <code>kafka-topics.sh --describe</code> 抽查若干 topic 的 ISR 是否完整——迁移模式 broker 重启后，它的分区副本需要有足够时间重新加入 ISR，过早推进下一台会让 ISR 收缩的窗口叠加。</p>\n<p>滚动顺序没有唯一的正确答案，但有两条经验规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>先迁<strong>低负载、非关键业务</strong>的 broker 当 canary，验证双写路径稳定后再迁承载核心订单/支付 topic 的 broker；</li>\n<li>承载<a href=\"../partition-storage-internals/log-segment-file-format-index\">分区日志段</a>数量最多、磁盘最满的 broker 放在最后，因为它的 metadata log 追赶最慢、重启风险最高；</li>\n<li>同一可用区内不要连续迁移两台以上，避免机架级故障域内的副本同时处于追赶状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果集群里存在非对称的 ID 分配（比如 ZK 时代从 100 开始编号、扩容时又插入了 200+），提前做一次 ID 盘点，避免与 controller 的 <code>node.id</code> 撞号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阶段三-finalize-停止双写-摘掉-zookeeper\">阶段三：finalize —— 停止双写、摘掉 ZooKeeper</h2><p>最后一台 broker 迁完、observer 全部追平后，controller 自动进入 <code>POST_MIGRATION</code>，双写停止。此时 ZK 上仍留有历史数据，但已经没有进程在读它了。</p>\n<p>收尾动作是纯配置操作：把所有节点（controller 与 broker）上的 <code>zookeeper.connect</code> 和 <code>zookeeper.metadata.migration.enable</code> 删除，然后逐个滚重启，controller 先、broker 后。全部重启完成后，用 <code>describe --status</code> 确认 <code>ZkMigrationState</code> 变为 <code>NONE</code>，再关停 ZooKeeper ensemble——建议先停一台观察 24 小时，确认没有隐藏读路径（遗留运维脚本、监控采集器、第三方工具直连 ZK）之后再停全部。</p>\n<p><strong>不可逆边界在这里。</strong> 官方不支持从 <code>POST_MIGRATION</code> 回退到 ZooKeeper——<a href=\"https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-866+ZooKeeper+to+KRaft+Migration\">KIP-866</a> 的设计里没有 downgrade 路径，因为双写停止后 ZK 的 znode 就不再更新，回退会丢失 finalize 之后发生的所有元数据变更。真正的回滚窗口只存在于 <code>MIGRATION</code> 期间：在任意时刻，把已迁移的 broker 用<strong>原来的 ZK 配置</strong>（去掉 <code>process.roles</code>、<code>node.id</code>、<code>controller.quorum.voters</code>，恢复纯 ZK 模式）重启，它就能退回 ZK 数据面。这个窗口在最后一台 broker 迁移完成的那一刻关闭。</p>\n<p>一个务实做法是在进入 <code>POST_MIGRATION</code> 后<strong>故意不立即摘 ZK 配置</strong>，让集群在这个状态下运行一到两个业务周期（跨一次完整促销、一次月度结算）。此时双写已停，ZK 只是被冷落，成本很低，但保留了&quot;重新配置回去&quot;的余地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结-迁移风险清单与时间估算\">小结：迁移风险清单与时间估算</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>缓解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>元数据日志暴涨</td>\n<td>十万级分区的一次性 ZK 状态导入</td>\n<td>提前确认 controller 数据盘余量与<a href=\"../metadata-log-record-storage/metadata-log-compaction-retention\">元数据日志的压缩/保留策略</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元数据版本被冻结</td>\n<td><code>metadata.version</code> 在迁移期被钉在 ZK 模式兼容的最高版本</td>\n<td>迁移完成前不要启用 KRaft 专属特性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>controller 磁盘 IO 打满</td>\n<td>双写期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>meta</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{meta}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">meta</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 突增（活动集中建 topic）</td>\n<td>避开大促窗口做迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>broker 追赶过慢</td>\n<td>observer 复制受 controller 出口带宽限制</td>\n<td>逐台迁移，追平再动下一台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ID 撞号</td>\n<td><code>node.id</code> 与既有 <code>broker.id</code> 冲突</td>\n<td>迁移前做一次全量 ID 盘点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凭证丢失</td>\n<td>SCRAM/ACL 未随 ZK 状态一并导入</td>\n<td>迁移后在 KRaft 上验证鉴权链路</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>滚动迁移的总时长可以用一条粗糙但实用的模型估算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>snapshot</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>restart</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mtext>catchup</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{total}} \\approx T_{\\text{snapshot}} + N \\times t_{\\text{restart}} + \\sum_{i=1}^{N} t_{\\text{catchup},i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">snapshot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">restart</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">catchup</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>snapshot</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{snapshot}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">snapshot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 controller 首次把 ZK 状态导入元数据日志的耗时（与分区数近似线性），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是 broker 数量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mtext>catchup</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{catchup},i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">catchup</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随元数据日志长度增长。真正的不可压缩项是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>catchup</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum t_{\\text{catchup}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">catchup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——它不受运维手法影响，只受 controller 与 broker 之间的复制能力约束。因此小集群（3-5 台 broker、万级分区以下）通常能在一个维护窗口内完成，而几十台 broker、数十万分区的集群应当按&quot;分批多个窗口&quot;规划：每个窗口迁一批 broker，批次之间让集群恢复稳态。</p>\n<p>迁移完成后还需要一次面向 KRaft 的复查。<a href=\"../kraft-raft-consensus-architecture/controller-failover-fencing-split-brain\">controller 故障切换与 fencing 机制</a>里描述的 fencing 行为在纯 KRaft 集群上的触发条件与 ZK 时代不同——迁移后应补做一次 controller 主动重启演练，确认 quorum 能在预期时间内选出新 leader，且 broker 侧的元数据缓存没有出现持续落后。这一步不做，等于把迁移的风险推迟到了第一次真实故障时。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ZooKeeper 到 KRaft 迁移与滚动切换（双写过渡、controller 引导、broker/controller 迁移顺序）","id":"zookeeper-到-kraft-迁移与滚动切换-双写过渡-controller-引导-broker-controller-迁移顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：ZkMigrationState 迁移状态机","id":"核心概念-zkmigrationstate-迁移状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"阶段一：先引导 controller quorum，不动任何 broker","id":"阶段一-先引导-controller-quorum-不动任何-broker"},{"level":2,"text":"阶段二：broker 逐台滚动迁移","id":"阶段二-broker-逐台滚动迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"阶段三：finalize —— 停止双写、摘掉 ZooKeeper","id":"阶段三-finalize-停止双写-摘掉-zookeeper"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：迁移风险清单与时间估算","id":"小结-迁移风险清单与时间估算"}],"prev":{"title":"索引重建、日志恢复与损坏处理（unclean shutdown、日志截断、不一致检测实操）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kafka-kraft-raft-storage-internals-broker/partition-storage-internals/index-rebuild-corruption-recovery"},"next":{"title":"滚动升级与 metadata.version / feature level 门控（升级路径、降级限制、兼容窗口）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kafka-kraft-raft-storage-internals-broker/operations-migration-upgrade/rolling-upgrade-metadata-version"}}